    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58063" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλώζω</span></b> , of the sound made by jackdaws, as
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρώζω</span> of crows, <i><span class="en">
			Poll.
			5.89
		</span></i>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>make a similar sound in token of disapprobation, hoot</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				D.
				21.226
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				3.71
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Aristid.
				<u>Or.</u>
				34(50).7
			</span></i>, etc.; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλώσσω</span>.</div>
